  <descriptors name="rail_soc_range_test_std" label="RAIL - SoC Range Test BLE and IEEE802.15.4" description="This application showcases the over-the-air range of Silicon Labs boards using 5 predefined standard PHYs. The sample app serves as both a Transmitter and a Receiver, with role selection available in the LCD menu. Flashing the app onto two separate boards facilitates testing of radio features and specifications. The LCD menu provides essential information about settings, allowing users to make changes. In Tx Mode, users can transmit packets, adjusting packet length and quantity. Output power can be set via the LCD menu. In Rx Mode, the app listens on the predefined PHY, displaying Packet Error Rate, Bit Error Rate and RSSI. CLI enables configuration control. Supported platforms include MicriumOS and FreeRTOS.&#xA;">
