  <descriptors name="rail_soc_simple_trx_multiphy" label="RAIL - SoC Simple TRX Multi-PHY" description="This application demonstrates the usage of multiple PHYs selectable by channels. Simple TRX Multi-PHY needs at least 3 devices, 2 endpoints, and a relay. The default setting is endpoint. After configuring different channels for the different endpoints, they can only communicate via the relay, which can receive messages on one channel and transmit the received packets on the other. NOTE: Due to the higher current consumption of continuous radio usage (especially in Rx Mode), it is not recommended to power the boards from a coin cell. Instead, a USB power bank can be used if portability is needed.&#xA;">
